# Trivy CVE allowlist for platform image scans (docker-build.yml).
# Every entry MUST include an expiry (YYYY-MM-DD) and a short reason.
# Format: CVE-YYYY-NNNNN (one per line). Lines starting with # are comments.
# Example:
# CVE-2024-12345  # expiry:2026-12-31 reason:waiting on upstream patch in base image
